<!--
No cabinet photograph is currently known for The Phrase That Pays.  Control
positions and the coin acceptor are reconstructed from the related Cobra 3
cabinet style.  The red, blue and green answer-button shades are inferred from
the matching on-screen choices; their physical colours are not confirmed.
The upper name panel, its colour, and the assignment of the three observed
lamp outputs to equal name-panel sections are also reconstructions.
-->
